    <dcterms:title xml:lang="en">Ord. No. 2025-28S. SUMMARY OF AN ORDINANCE AMENDING AMERICAN CANYON MUNICIPAL CODE TITLE 16 TO REPEAL AND REPLACE THE 2022 CALIFORNIA BUILDING STANDARDS CODE WITH THE 2025 EDITION WITH LOCAL AMENDMENTS; AND REPEAL AND REPLACE THE 2021 INTERNATIONAL PROPERTY MAINTENANCE CODE WITH THE 2024 EDITION AND RELATED MODEL CODES WITH APPENDICES AND AMENDMENTS AS IDENTIFIED THROUGH EXPRESS FINDINGS OF LOCAL NECESSITY</dcterms:title>
